WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
(laughing)

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.180
- I am not popular on Instagram, at all.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.750
Today, I'm asking a bunch
of people that I work with,

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:14.090
a bunch of people I don't work
with, anyone I can think of,

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:17.139
I'm asking them to flood my
Instagram with notifications.

00:00:17.139 --> 00:00:20.056
(electronic music)

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.003
So have you ever turned
on your notifications?

00:00:24.219 --> 00:00:26.050
- Like on to my phone?
- Yeah.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.760
Like push notifications.
- Yeah.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.350
So that's what I had at the beginning

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:34.140
of when I started BuzzFeed
and then I was in a video

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:37.803
that like popped off, and then
I turned those things off.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:40.960
(suspenseful music)

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:45.390
- It's still not giving
me push notifications.

00:00:45.651 --> 00:00:48.651
(suspenseful music)

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.410
So, Spenser gets push
notifications on Instagram,

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.913
which means it's possible.

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:55.303
I'm gonna add my account
to Spenser's phone.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.320
My concern is why does
yours work and none of,

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.203
literally no one else's does.

00:00:59.371 --> 00:01:02.371
(suspenseful music)

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.580
Two minutes till fresh
content, let's do this.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.390
- What's happening?

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:09.893
- Oh, you need to follow
Spenser right now.

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:12.370
- This is really making
me rethink the content

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:14.117
I have on my Instagram.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.299
- Jessica, spread the word.
- Jessica, you spread the word

00:01:17.299 --> 00:01:18.132
- Bye!

00:01:18.132 --> 00:01:19.080
- Flood Spenser!

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.830
- [Woman] Terrifying!

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:24.281
(screaming)

00:01:26.308 --> 00:01:28.300
- I've never clicked
"like" so much in my life.

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:29.870
- It looks pretty cool.

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:32.300
It looks like a waterfall, and it's funny,

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.750
because we called it a flood.

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:36.163
Spenser got a lot of
attention today, which,

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:39.003
she probably loved, right?

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:40.287
Woo hoo!

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:42.660
Thank you everybody!

00:01:43.128 --> 00:01:43.961
Yay!

00:01:43.961 --> 00:01:46.211
- [Woman] Yeah, you did it.

00:01:46.408 --> 00:01:49.075
(upbeat music)

